      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It was still the same Christopher and Adam song at the end I heard.   Where did you hear it get it altered to Christopher and Paul?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You want the song at the start-ish of the episode, at ~22 minutes.</p>\n<p>As for the rest of the episode… Paul is both incredibly intelligent and adorable and so while I will miss Adam half the time, I will also appreciate our twice monthly dose of Paul.</p>\n<p>Especially since I’d wanted to know more about his time at the Human Genome Institute ever since it was mentioned in the GTG Origin Episode (because that is <span class=\"bbcode-i\">so wicked cool</span>), so now I am content.</p>",
