      "created_at": "2020-08-19T16:13:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I also very much approve of this being a lot more “talk about the hosts and industry inside baseball”. If Publisher’s Notes end up being heavy on the “how things work” questions, I won’t miss the lore. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>FWIW, they are going to go back at least somewhat to answering lore questions next time. This was just a case where we in the Discord were so incredibly excited to be talking to The Paul that we asked so many questions to Paul personally they had to punt the letters for a week. XD</p>\n<p>But since we’re going to be getting 2 or 3 of these a month for at least a few months, I wouldn’t be surprised if they got to work through a backlog of all sorts of questions.</p>",
